it-margin-start:-1px;margin-inline-start:-1px;-webkit-margin-end:-1px;margin-inline-end:-1px;overflow:hidden;padding-block-start:0;padding-block-end:0;-webkit-padding-start:0;padding-inline-start:0;-webkit-padding-end:0;padding-inline-end:0;position:absolute;inline-size:1px;white-space:nowrap;word-wrap:normal;}</style><span class=\"css-8u2krs esbq1260\"><span>&amp;nbsp;</span></span></div></div><div id=\"benefits\" data-testid=\"benefits-test\" class=\"css-727s eu4oa1w0\"><h3 id=\"benefitsSectionTitle\" class=\"css-177sybi e1tiznh50\">Benefits</h3><p class=\"css-cm4jn5 e1wnkr790\">Pulled from the full job description</p><div class=\"css-1uv070a eu4oa1w0\"><div class=\"css-1b5g84r eu4oa1w0\"><span class=\"css-cwoxxg e1wnkr790\"><ul class=\"css-shcbig eu4oa1w0\"><li class=\"css-u74ql7 eu4oa1w0\">Flexible schedule</li></ul></span></div></div><style data-emotion=\"css hwvpa9\">.css-hwvpa9{display:-webkit-box;display:-webkit-flex;display:-ms-flexbox;display:flex;position:relative;-webkit-box-flex-wrap:wrap;-webkit-flex-wrap:wrap;-ms-flex-wrap:wrap;flex-wrap:wrap;text-align:center;-webkit-align-items:center;-webkit-box-align:center;-ms-flex-align:center;align-items:center;-webkit-align-self:stretch;-ms-flex-item-align:stretch;align-self:stretch;-webkit-box-pack:center;-ms-flex-pack:center;-webkit-justify-content:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--ifl-colors-foreground);inline-size:100%;padding-block-start:1rem;margin-block-start:0;margin-block-end:0;margin-inline:-0.875rem;inline-size:auto;}.css-hwvpa9::before,.css-hwvpa9::after{content:\"\";-webkit-flex:1 1 auto;-ms-flex:1 1 auto;flex:1 1 auto;background-color:var(--ifl-colors-border-weak);block-size:1px;}.css-hwvpa9 .e15p7aqh0{padding-block-start:0.5rem;padding-block-end:0.5rem;-webkit-padding-start:0.5rem;padding-inline-start:0.5rem;-webkit-padding-end:0.5rem;padding-inline-end:0.5rem;}</style><div role=\"separator\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" class=\"css-hwvpa9 e15p7aqh1\"><span class=\"css-8u2krs esbq1260\"><span>&amp;nbsp;</span></span></div></div><div id=\"jobDescriptionTitle\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"jobDescriptionTitleHeading\" class=\"css-15dd00f e1tiznh50\">Full job description</h2></div><div id=\"jobDescriptionText\" class=\"jobsearch-JobComponent-description css-jsfa0i eu4oa1w0\"><p>Before coming in for the interview, please take a moment to visit our website and get familiar with the kind of work we do.</p>\n<p><b>About the Role</b></p>\n<p>We’re looking for a Full Stack Developer who’s comfortable working with both frontend and backend technologies. You’ll build and maintain fast, reliable web applications using <b>Next.js</b> and <b>Nest.js</b>, working closely with designers and content teams.</p>\n<p>If you enjoy solving problems and building things end to end, this role fits well.</p>\n<p><b>What You’ll Do</b></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Build and maintain web applications using Next.js and Nest.js</li>\n <li>Create responsive, mobile-friendly interfaces that work across browsers</li>\n <li>Integrate APIs, third-party tools, and custom features</li>\n <li>Fix bugs and improve performance when issues come up</li>\n <li>Collaborate with designers and content creators for smooth user experiences</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>What We’re Looking For</b></p>\n<ul>\n <li>0–1 year of experience in full stack development</li>\n <li>Strong understanding of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, and Node.js</li>\n <li>Hands-on experience with Next.js and Nest.js</li>\n <li>Knowledge of REST APIs, databases, and Git</li>\n <li>Good problem-solving skills and attention to detail</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Bonus (Nice to Have)</b></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Basic understanding of SEO and performance optimization</li>\n <li>Experience with server-side rendering (SSR) and static site generation (SSG)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Why Join Us</b></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Supportive and collaborative team</li>\n <li>Clear growth and learning opportunities</li>\n <li>Flexible work hours with remote options</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you’re excited about building modern web applications and growing your skills, we’d love to connect.</p>\n<p>Job Type: Internship</p>\n<p>Pay: ₹7,000.00 - ₹10,000.00 per month</p>\n<p>Work Location: In person</p></div><style data-emotion=\"css 1f63e20\">.css-1f63e20{display:-webkit-box;display:-webkit-flex;display:-ms-flexbox;display:flex;position:relative;-webkit-box-flex-wrap:wrap;-webkit-flex-wrap:wrap;-ms-flex-wrap:wrap;flex-wrap:wrap;text-align:center;-webkit-align-items:center;-webkit-box-align:center;-ms-flex-align:center;align-items:center;-webkit-align-self:stretch;-ms-flex-item-align:stretch;align-self:stretch;-webkit-box-pack:center;-ms-flex-pack:center;-webkit-justify-content:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--ifl-colors-foreground);inline-size:100%;padding-block-start:1.5rem;margin-block-start:0;margin-block-end:0;margin-inline:-0.875rem;inline-size:auto;}.css-1f63e20::before,.css-1f63e20::after{content:\"\";-webkit-flex:1 1 auto;-ms-flex:1 1 auto;flex:1 1 auto;background-color:var(--ifl-colors-border-weak);block-size:1px;}.css-1f63e20 .e15p7aqh0{padding-block-start:0.5rem;padding-block-end:0.5rem;-webkit-padding-start:0.5rem;padding-inline-start:0.5rem;-webkit-padding-end:0.5rem;padding-inline-end:0.5rem;}</style><div role=\"separator\" aria-orientation=\"horizontal\" class=\"css-1f63e20 e15p7aqh1\"><span class=\"css-8u2krs esbq1260\"><span>&amp;nbsp;</span></span></div></div><div id=\"mosaic-belowFullJobDescription\" class=\"mosaic mosaic-empty-zone\"></div><div class=\"jobsearch-JobMetadataFooter css-y200ks eu4oa1w0\"><div id=\"successfullySignedInModal\"></div><div class=\"css-16spgjx e37uo190\"><style data-emotion=\"css 10ft6qd\">.css-10ft6qd{box-sizing:border-box;margin-block-start:0;margin-block-end:0;-webkit-margin-start:0;margin-inline-start:0;-webkit-margin-end:0;margin-inline-end:0;min-inline-size:0;}html[dir=rtl] .css-10ft6qd .mosaic-reportcontent-button-icon:before{-webkit-transform:scaleX(-1);-moz-transform:scaleX(-1);-ms-transform:scaleX(-1