\"interactivePreferenceCollectionTst\":-1,\"isJobDetailPreferenceCollectionEnabled\":false,\"isJobDetailsShiftPreferenceCollectionEnabled\":false,\"isJobExpired\":false,\"isMobPreferenceMatchVJActive\":true,\"isSimpleVJImproveActive\":true,\"jobTypes\":[{\"customClassLabels\":[],\"customClassSuids\":[],\"label\":\"Internship\",\"sentiment\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"suid\":\"VDTG7\"}],\"salaryInfoModel\":null,\"segmentPreferences\":[],\"shifts\":null,\"shiftsAndSchedule\":null,\"title\":\"Job details\"},\"order\":[\"JOB_DETAILS\",\"QUALIFICATIONS\"],\"qualificationsSectionModel\":null},\"jobInfoHeaderModel\":{\"companyImagesModel\":{\"ejiBannerAsBackground\":false,\"enhancedJobDescription\":false,\"featuredEmployer\":false,\"headerImageUrl\":null,\"logoAltText\":\"Metaminds Studio logo\",\"logoImageOverlayLower\":false,\"logoUrl\":null,\"showBannerTop\":false,\"showEnhancedJobImp\":false,\"showIconInTitle\":false,\"showJpBrandLogo\":false},\"companyName\":\"Metaminds Studio\",\"companyOverviewLink\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fin.indeed.com\\u002Fcmp\\u002FMetaminds-Studio?campaignid=mobvjcmp&from=mobviewjob&tk=1jt4aqqed259f000&fromjk=8c155e7d83a6a1f5\",\"companyReviewLink\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fin.indeed.com\\u002Fcmp\\u002FMetaminds-Studio\\u002Freviews?campaignid=mobvjcmp&cmpratingc=mobviewjob&from=mobviewjob&tk=1jt4aqqed259f000&fromjk=8c155e7d83a6a1f5&jt=Full+Stack+Developer+Intern\",\"companyReviewModel\":null,\"employerActivity\":null,\"employerProvidedOccupations\":[],\"employerResponsiveCardModel\":null,\"encryptedFccCompanyId\":null,\"formattedLocation\":\"Wagle Estate, Thane, Maharashtra\",\"hideRating\":false,\"isCondensedRating\":true,\"isDesktopApplyButtonSticky\":true,\"isSimpleVjImproveActive\":true,\"isSimplifiedHeader\":false,\"jobFlairLabelModel\":null,\"jobNormTitle\":null,\"jobTitle\":\"Full Stack Developer Intern\",\"jobTypes\":null,\"location\":null,\"openCompanyLinksInNewTab\":true,\"parentCompanyName\":null,\"ratingsModel\":null,\"recentSearch\":null,\"remoteLocation\":false,\"remoteWorkModel\":null,\"salaryCurrency\":null,\"salaryMax\":null,\"salaryMin\":null,\"salaryType\":null,\"subtitle\":\"Metaminds Studio - Wagle Estate, Thane, Maharashtra\",\"tagModels\":null,\"taxonomyAttributes\":null,\"viewJobDisplay\":\"DESKTOP_STANDALONE\"},\"jobMetadataHeaderModel\":{\"jobType\":null},\"jobTagModel\":null,\"resumeEvaluationResult\":null,\"sanitizedJobDescription\":\"\\u003Cp>Before coming in for the interview, please take a moment to visit our website and get familiar with the kind of work we do.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>About the Role\\u003C\\u002Fb>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cp>We’re looking for a Full Stack Developer who’s comfortable working with both frontend and backend technologies. You’ll build and maintain fast, reliable web applications using \\u003Cb>Next.js\\u003C\\u002Fb> and \\u003Cb>Nest.js\\u003C\\u002Fb>, working closely with designers and content teams.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cp>If you enjoy solving problems and building things end to end, this role fits well.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>What You’ll Do\\u003C\\u002Fb>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cul>\\n \\u003Cli>Build and maintain web applications using Next.js and Nest.js\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Create responsive, mobile-friendly interfaces that work across browsers\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Integrate APIs, third-party tools, and custom features\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Fix bugs and improve performance when issues come up\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Collaborate with designers and content creators for smooth user experiences\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\n\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>What We’re Looking For\\u003C\\u002Fb>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cul>\\n \\u003Cli>0–1 year of experience in full stack development\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Strong understanding of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, and Node.js\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Hands-on experience with Next.js and Nest.js\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Knowledge of REST APIs, databases, and Git\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Good problem-solving skills and attention to detail\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\n\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Bonus (Nice to Have)\\u003C\\u002Fb>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cul>\\n \\u003Cli>Basic understanding of SEO and performance optimization\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Experience with server-side rendering (SSR) and static site generation (SSG)\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\n\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Why Join Us\\u003C\\u002Fb>\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cul>\\n \\u003Cli>Supportive and collaborative team\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Clear growth and learning opportunities\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n \\u003Cli>Flexible work hours with remote options\\u003C\\u002Fli>\\n\\u003C\\u002Ful>\\n\\u003Cp>If you’re excited about building modern web applications and growing your skills, we’d love to connect.\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cp>Job Type: Internship\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cp>Pay: ₹7,000.00 - ₹10,000.00 per month\\u003C\\u002Fp>\\n\\u003Cp>Work Location: In person\\u003C\\u002Fp>\",\"showExpiredHeader\":false,\"structuredDataJobSummaryModel\":null,\"tagModels\":null,\"viewJobDisplay\":\"DESKTOP_STANDALONE\"},\"sectionedJobInfoModel\":null},\"jobKey\":\"8c155e7d83a6a1f5\",\"jobLanguage\":\"en\",\"jobLocation\":\"Wagle Estate, Thane, Maharashtra\",\"jobMetadataFooterModel\":{\"advertiserName\":\"\",\"age\":\"1 day ago\",\"isShowJapanSafeJobSearchGuidelinesDisclaimer\":false,\"nexusModel\":{\"accommodationEmail\":null,\"accommodationPhoneNumber\":null,\"accommodationUrl\":null,\"showNexusDisclaimer\":false},\"originalJobLink\":null,\"phoneNumber\":null,\"saveJobLink\":null,\"showReportJobAsButton\":true,\"source\":null},\"jobOccupations\":[\"5NN53\",\"EHPW9\",\"HJSX6\"],\"jobSeekerSuidsToFactIds\":[],\"jobSeenData\":\"tk=1jt4aqqed259f000&context=viewjobrecs\",\"jobTitle\":\"Full Stack Developer Intern\",\"language\":\"en\",\"lastVisitTime\":0,\"lazyProviders\":{\"mosaic-provider-reportcontent\":\"\\u003Cstyle data-emotio