            "text": "globalThis[\"indeed.i18n.localeData\"]={3639188:[\"Nottingham High School\"],0xc13813:[\"Postcode format is incorrect.\"],0x26ba9e0:[\"Save Job and exit\"],0x70dd372:[\"Sales Representative - Indeed, Nottingham\"],0x85d697d:[\"Do not sell my personal information (opens in a new window)\"],0x8cc8b48:[\"Your CV wasn't uploaded. Try again.\"],0xcdeb272:[\"Answer must be a valid date in the form {0}\"],0x18afb8cb:[\"First name must be less than {0} characters. You can edit your CV or apply with a different CV.\"],0x1ad6bb11:[\"That code didn't work. Please recheck and try again.\"],0x1c2a277a:[\"There’s a technical problem with an employer’s question\"],0x1de45dc2:[\"Are you authorised to work lawfully in this country for {0} if hired?\"],0x1e92955d:[\"We could not save your changes\"],0x208c09dc:[\"Verify your email address to apply for this job and keep track of your applications on Indeed.\"],0x21fd2fe1:[\"The verification code should consist of 6 digits. Please recheck and try again.\"],0x26a33032:[\"Out-of-country question\"],0x2cfa5629:[\"City, State must be less than 1 {0} characters.\"],0x351fa203:[\"By pressing continue, you will see questions from the employer that are part of this application. For your convenience, information you provided on your Indeed CV will be used to pre-fill these questions, but you may change the answers in any field.\"],0x3752b9f1:[\"Use a smaller CV file\"],0x3a58ba2b:[\"Add your name to your CV. You can either edit your CV or apply with a different CV.\"],0x3e372a37:[\"The application email must be a correct email address.\"],0x45774ddc:[\"CV\"],0x467c3d25:[\"Full job description\"],0x4b1b50a5:[\"Close job description\"],0x4dd21fb6:[\"By pressing apply, 1) You agree to Indeed''s <a {0}>Terms of Service, Cookie Policy and Privacy Policy</a>. 2) You consent to your application being transmitted to the Employer; Indeed does not guarantee receipt. 3) You consent to your application being processed and analysed in accordance with the Employer''s and Indeed''s terms and privacy practices. 4) You acknowledge that when you apply for jobs in countries outside your own it may involve you sending your personal data to countries with lower levels of data protection.\"],0x4fdd74de:[\"This email cannot receive messages from employers; please use a different email address.\"],0x51425e33:[\"Our system is having some trouble saving your application progress. You can save this Job to My Jobs and try to apply again later.\"],0x517f462a:[\"Upload a different CV file type\"],0x5305fbe4:[\"Afterwards, you'll use your email address to sign in and get updates from Indeed, and we'll save it to your profile.\"],0x567a9b76:[\"You have already applied to this job\"],0x5b2cb2fc:[\"Your CV contains characters from a language not supported by Indeed CV. Please edit it or apply with a different CV to continue.\"],0x67ec8c69:[\"Your privacy choices (opens in a new window)\"],0x7174ce11:[\"The encrypted application email must be a correct email address.\"],0x71fcfe45:[\"You're currently subscribed to receive calls or text messages from employers you've applied to, and Indeed. You can change this in [Privacy settings|key].\"],0x73a68bef:[\"Certification or licence name is required\"],0x754d5323:[\"Please note that this job is hosted by {0}''s affiliate [Indeed|indeedBaseUrl]. By pressing apply: 1) you agree to Indeed''s [Terms, Cookie and Privacy Policies|indeedToS] and {1}''s [Terms of Use|partnerTerms] and [Privacy Policy|partnerPrivacy]; 2) you consent to your application being transmitted to the Employer (Indeed does not guarantee receipt), and processed and analysed in accordance with its and Indeed''s terms and privacy policies; and 3) you acknowledge that when you apply to jobs outside your country it may involve you sending your personal data to countries with lower levels of data protection.\"],0x75d08bfe:[\"Issues with my CV or cover letter\"],0x762e57a1:[\"Add a CV for the employer\"],0x7772efb9:[\"Job information cannot be found.\"],0x7f14eaf4:[\"Example CV\"],0x83a2954b:[\"By clicking the button to submit your application, you agree: 1) to Indeed's [Terms of Service, Privacy Policy and Cookie Policy|indeedToS]; 2) that your application will be transmitted to the Employer (Indeed does not guarantee receipt); 3) that your application and any other communications through Indeed will be processed and analysed in accordance with our and the Employer's terms and privacy policies for the purposes of improving services, etc.; and 4) that Indeed may collect information regarding the screening process from the Employer.\"],0x8488d851:[\"Job title is required\"],0x892638e0:[\"Certifications and licences\"],0x92cae4d0:[\"E-mail verification\"],0x93c2dedc:[\"Edit certifications and licences\"],0x94245cbb:[\"Last name must be less than {0} characters. You can edit your CV or apply with a different CV.\"],0x98db79de:[\"You can [change your email address|{0}] or [re-send the email|{1}]\"],0x9beb5541:[\"Add your last name to your CV. You can either edit your CV or apply with a different CV.\"],0x9cbd76f7:[\"For your security, you need to verify your email address to continue applying to this job.\"],0xace39ff1:[\"Add your first name to your CV. You can either edit your CV or apply with a different CV.\"],0xad3a6581:[\"Job has expired.\"],0xaf24a921:[\"Add certifications and licences\"],0xb50757de:[\"Shop Assistant - Ready Grocery, Nottingham\"],0xb645e88a:[\"By submitting your phone number, you confirm that you are the subscriber and primary owner and you consent to receive calls and text messages from Indeed and employers.\"],0xb7a0ec03:[\"Answer Screener Questions from the employer | Indeed\"],0xb7e0104b:[\"This CV has fewer than {0} words. Help employers get to know you by adding more detail.\"],0xbc2a6c2b:[\"By pressing apply: 1) you agree to our [Terms, Cookie and Privacy Policies|key]; 2) you consent to your application being transmitted to the Employer (Indeed does not guarantee receipt), and processed and analysed in accordance with its and Indeed's terms and privacy policies; 3) you acknowledge that, when you submit applications for jobs outside your country, it may involve you sending your personal data to countries with lower levels of data protection; and 4) you further acknowledge that we may hide your contact information until this employer moves forward with your application. [What the employer sees|exampleRedactedUrl]\"],0xc225cd6e:[\"Compress any images in your supporting documents and reduce your number of files, then upload again.\"],0xca1e8b8f:[\"By pressing apply, you consent to your application being transmitted to the Employer, and being processed and analysed in accordance with the Employer''s privacy practices, Indeed''s <a {0}>Cookie Policy</a>, <a {1}>Privacy Policy</a> and you agree to Indeed''s <a {2}>Terms of Service</a>.\"],0xccb46c9b:[\"Looking to change your account email address? Go to [account settings|key].\"],0xd6249343:[\"{0} - {1}\"],0xdb27098f:[\"There was a problem re-sending the confirmation email.\"],0xe03b75a6:[\"Please note that this job is hosted by Glassdoor's affiliate [Indeed|indeedBaseUrl]. By pressing apply: 1) you agree to Indeed's [Terms, Cookie and Privacy Policies|indeedToS] and Glassdoor's [Terms of Use|partnerTerms] and [Privacy Policy|partnerPrivacy]; 2) you consent to your application being transmitted to the Employer (Indeed does not guarantee receipt), and processed and analysed in accordance with its, Glassdoor's and Indeed's terms and privacy policies; and 3) you acknowledge that when you apply to jobs outside your country it may involve you sending your personal data to countries with lower levels of data protection.\"],0xe6a02bf2:[\"By pressing apply: 1) You consent to your application being transmitted to the Employer; Indeed does not guarantee receipt. 2) You agree to Indeed''s <a {2}>Terms of Service</a>. 3) You consent to your application being processed and analysed in accordance with the Employer''s privacy practices, Indeed''s <a {0}>Cookie Policy</a>, and <a {1}>Privacy Policy</a>. 4) You acknowledge that when you apply for jobs in countries outside your own it may involve you sending your personal data to countries with lower levels of data protection.\"],0xe8435340:[\"Edit CV\"],0xf87b144d:[\"Postcode must be less than {0} characters.\"],0xfa315d38:[\"You agree to receive SMS interview updates on [{0}|key] from employers you''ve applied to and Indeed. Message frequencies vary. Message and data rates may apply. Reply HELP for help or STOP to cancel.\"],0xfb825d7a:[\"Decline to answer\"],0xfc581805:[\"Tick this box to receive calls or text messages on the number you provided from employers you've applied to, and Indeed.\"],\"\":{\"Content-Type\":\"text/plain; charset=UTF-8\",Locale:\"en_IN\",\"Plural-Forms\":\"nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;\",\"Project-Name\":\"smart-apply-webapp\",salt:5381,id_length:42}};"
